cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FungMod in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "FungMod: traceable, uncertainty-aware virtual experiments for fungal and enzyme-mediated substrate degradation"
abstract: >-
  FungMod is a registry-backed, uncertainty-aware, mechanistic virtual-experiment
  engine for fungal and enzyme-mediated substrate degradation. It connects
  explicit mechanisms and provenance-backed parameters to trajectories, summary
  metrics, uncertainty summaries, provenance, limitations, and suggested
  follow-up experiments, while keeping missing inputs explicit and never
  presenting software verification as empirical validation.
type: software
authors:
